<section class="section" aria-labelledby="map-note-heading">
  <div class="notice-panel">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Boundary interpretation</p>
      <h2 id="map-note-heading">Legal status and map geometry are documented separately</h2>
      <p>
        The Rajasthan Forest Department's notification dated 5 October 2023 and the updated Tiger Conservation
        Plan record Bhainsrodgarh Wildlife Sanctuary as part of the MHTR core. The reserve lines on these public
        maps use OpenStreetMap geometry for orientation; they are not presented as cadastral or legal demarcation.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="button-link" href="/resources/documents/rajasthan-mhtr-amending-notification-2023/">Open archived 2023 notification</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="esz-evidence" aria-labelledby="esz-evidence-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Official ESZ evidence</p>
    <h2 id="esz-evidence-heading">How to read the 2026 KMZ correctly</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      The supplied <strong>MHTR.kmz</strong> is byte-identical to the MHTR download in the Rajasthan Forest
      Department register under “ESZ KML as on 01.06.2026.” Its polygon records the <em>outer limit</em> around
      the reserve and eco-sensitive zone. It is not a standalone polygon for the ESZ band and must not replace
      the reserve or core outline.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="landscape-stat-grid" aria-label="Eco-sensitive-zone area interpretation">
    <article class="landscape-stat-card card">
      <span class="landscape-stat-value">248.70 km²</span>
      <h3>Notified ESZ area</h3>
      <p>Area stated in Gazette notification S.O. 4268(E), dated 25 November 2020.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="landscape-stat-card card">
      <span class="landscape-stat-value">0–1.0 km</span>
      <h3>Notified extent</h3>
      <p>The ESZ width varies by direction and is zero where the notification records co-termination with the buffer.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="landscape-stat-card card">
      <span class="landscape-stat-value">≈1,006.03 km²</span>
      <h3>KML outer envelope</h3>
      <p>Geodesic calculation of the supplied polygon after its inner ring. This includes the reserve interior and is not the ESZ area.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="source-panel">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Provenance record</p>
      <h2>Official file, dated and verified</h2>
      <dl class="home-facts">
        <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>Rajasthan Forest Department</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Portal date</dt><dd>ESZ KML as on 1 June 2026</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Source filename</dt><dd>MHTR.kmz / MHTR-ESZ.kml</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Geometry</dt><dd>3,546-point outer ring and one 61-point unlabeled inner ring</dd></div>
        <div>
          <dt>SHA-256</dt>
          <dd><code>fe784add4d17d84f<wbr>7bf7191c8b401312<wbr>f20a74ed91dc3d5d<wbr>546fb3d265a828ea</code></dd>
        </div>
        <div><dt>Map treatment</dt><dd>Outer limit only; the inner ring is preserved without assigning an unsupported meaning</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="source-actions">
      <a class="button-link" href="/assets/data/gis/mhtr-esz-outer-limit-2026-06-01.kmz" download>Download local KMZ copy</a>
